            "detailed_description": "<h1>DEVOUT EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/0f0a8927481da0606302dd5a9dd188d8.avif?t=1792757901\" width=1024 height=1344 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.poster.avif?t=1792757901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.webm?t=1792757901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.mp4?t=1792757901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/64de61851fc4e51d66cbb1349f9c6030.avif?t=1792757901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/64de61851fc4e51d66cbb1349f9c6030.webp?t=1792757901 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mortal Shell II é uma sequela independente de Mortal Shell que expande o original de forma significativa com combates sem restrições, carregados de adrenalina, amplas melhorias nas armas e exploração livre. <br><br>As oito Shells esquecidas dos guerreiros perdidos estão espalhadas por todo o mundo devastado de Mortal Shell II.<br><br> Procura e apodera-te destas Shells, liberta as suas habilidades inatas e descobre a história de cada uma delas ao decifrar os seus segredos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/c0e3ced798be9dbbf7d2a95e54f81966.avif?t=1792757901\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/929614c7c39527ce9860877b9480ddd6.avif?t=1792757901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/929614c7c39527ce9860877b9480ddd6.webp?t=1792757901 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mortal Shell II oferece um sistema de combate responsivo, ágil e pragmático, com opções que permitem pensar de forma estratégica sobre o combate corpo a corpo e as armas de maior alcance. <br><br>Sem as restrições de energia, os jogadores exploram múltiplas táticas para desmantelar a postura inimiga e desferir golpes críticos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.poster.avif?t=1792757901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.webm?t=1792757901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.mp4?t=1792757901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/1d8110aa1cc1cc18bf23cf8646c674a0.avif?t=1792757901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/1d8110aa1cc1cc18bf23cf8646c674a0.webp?t=1792757901 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">O mundo aberto de Mortal Shell II é compacto, fortemente interligado e imersivo. Foi concebido com respeito pelo tempo do jogador. <br><br>Aqueles que se afastam do caminho dourado podem descobrir novas Shells, armas, melhorias, curiosidades e mais.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.poster.avif?t=1792757901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.webm?t=1792757901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/d2134969ba7cc8c4f492b2f8aaab56ac.mp4?t=1792757901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/64de61851fc4e51d66cbb1349f9c6030.avif?t=1792757901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/64de61851fc4e51d66cbb1349f9c6030.webp?t=1792757901 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mortal Shell II é uma sequela independente de Mortal Shell que expande o original de forma significativa com combates sem restrições, carregados de adrenalina, amplas melhorias nas armas e exploração livre. <br><br>As oito Shells esquecidas dos guerreiros perdidos estão espalhadas por todo o mundo devastado de Mortal Shell II.<br><br> Procura e apodera-te destas Shells, liberta as suas habilidades inatas e descobre a história de cada uma delas ao decifrar os seus segredos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/c0e3ced798be9dbbf7d2a95e54f81966.avif?t=1792757901\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/929614c7c39527ce9860877b9480ddd6.avif?t=1792757901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/929614c7c39527ce9860877b9480ddd6.webp?t=1792757901 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mortal Shell II oferece um sistema de combate responsivo, ágil e pragmático, com opções que permitem pensar de forma estratégica sobre o combate corpo a corpo e as armas de maior alcance. <br><br>Sem as restrições de energia, os jogadores exploram múltiplas táticas para desmantelar a postura inimiga e desferir golpes críticos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.poster.avif?t=1792757901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.webm?t=1792757901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/538950c9cd1e0834cf763f8697960ff7.mp4?t=1792757901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/1d8110aa1cc1cc18bf23cf8646c674a0.avif?t=1792757901\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/1d8110aa1cc1cc18bf23cf8646c674a0.webp?t=1792757901 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">O mundo aberto de Mortal Shell II é compacto, fortemente interligado e imersivo. Foi concebido com respeito pelo tempo do jogador. <br><br>Aqueles que se afastam do caminho dourado podem descobrir novas Shells, armas, melhorias, curiosidades e mais.</p>",
            "short_description": "A sua carne é a tua arma. O Mortal Shell II é uma sequela independente e um RPG de ação com combates ferozes e repletos de adrenalina. Recruta guerreiros excecionais, derruba falsos deuses e redime um mundo devastado.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Francês, Italiano, Alemão, Espanhol (Espanha), Japonês, Polaco, Português (Brasil), Português (Portugal), Russo, Chinês simplificado, Espanhol (América Latina), Chinês tradicional, Coreano, Ucraniano<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
